  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n\n- Add parameterless IHostBuilder overload and read logging settings from a single configuration (`a521d1d`)\n\n### Changed\n\n- Updated workflow to automatically generate the changelog (`af97a83`)\n- Updated the configuration of writing to console and file to be able to be overridable from serilog configuration section (`013fcef`)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Incorrect arrangement of dotnet build test and pack (`efbbc1b`)\n- Removed unused serilog exception reference (`49689d5`)\n- Forgot to update the correct path (`11f35af`)\n- Added a proper readme for users to be able to properly configure and use the library (`d591539`)\n\n### Documentation\n\n- Updated changelog (`d43caf2`)\n\n### Other\n\n- Added automatic create of github release once publish completes (`b4e5e63`)",
